<title>Autolith — a programming agent that can rewrite itself while it runs</title>
<meta name="description" content="Autolith is a terminal programming agent inside a live Common Lisp image. It works in your repository, answers over corpora larger than the model window, and can inspect, modify, break and recover its own runtime.">
